594}, {"text": "X-rays later revealed over 30 interlocking precision gears inside a wooden box.", "s": 15.714, "e": 22.064}, {"text": "Built around 100 BC, the Antikythera Mechanism tracked the sun, moon, and planets, predicted solar eclipses, and even counted down the four-year cycle to the Olympic Games.", "s": 22.184, "e": 36.255}, {"text": "Clockwork that complex wouldn't appear in Europe again for over a millennium.", "s": 36.375, "e": 41.008}]}